hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1239","Muhammad Ibn Rafi’ told us, Abd al-Razzaq told us, Ibn Jurayj, H, Muhammad Ibn Sinan al-Qazzaz told us, and Muhammad Ibn Sadran told us, They said: Abu Asim told us, on the authority of Ibn Jurayj, Uthman bin Abi Sulaiman told me, that Abu Salamah bin Abdul Rahman told him, Aisha told him that the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, “did not die until he had performed most of his prayers sitting.” Ibn Rafi’ and Ibn Sadran said: Much of his prayer was while he was sitting."
